{#if term.ambiguous == 2}
  {!white}Часть букв занимает две клетки.{!}
  {!white}Из-за этого экраны станции ломаются.{!}
  {!white}Some characters take two cells. This breaks the screens.{!}
  {!white}Kai kurie simboliai užima du langelius. Dėl to ekranai suyra.{!}

  Включите одну клетку и войдите снова.
  Set them to one cell and connect again.
  Nustatykite vieną langelį ir prisijunkite iš naujo.

  {!hi}PuTTY{!}             Window > Translation:
                    clear "Treat CJK ambiguous characters as wide"
  {!hi}Tera Term{!}         Setup > Additional settings > Encoding:
                    Ambiguous Characters width = 1 Cell
  {!hi}xterm{!}             XTerm*cjkWidth: false, or no -cjk_width
  {!hi}iTerm2{!}            Settings > Profiles > Text:
                    clear "Ambiguous characters are double-width"
  {!hi}Windows Terminal{!}  Settings > Compatibility:
                    Width of ambiguous characters = Narrow, restart
  {!hi}GNOME Terminal{!}    Preferences > profile > Compatibility:
                    Ambiguous-width characters = Narrow
  {!hi}Ptyxis{!}            Preferences > Behavior > Compatibility:
                    Ambiguous-width Characters = Narrow
{~}
